 01 L-EVENT                BINARY-LONG.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-INDEX L-ITEM L-COUNT L-VAR L-SONG L-LENGTH L-COMPARATOR L-HAS-RECORD L-EVENT.
     MOVE L-ITEM TO BE-SLOT-ITEM(L-INDEX, 1)
     MOVE L-COUNT TO BE-SLOT-COUNT(L-INDEX, 1)
     MOVE L-VAR TO BE-SLOT-VAR(L-INDEX, 1)
     MOVE 0 TO L-HAS-RECORD BE-XI(L-INDEX, 5)
     IF L-COUNT > 0
         MOVE 1 TO L-HAS-RECORD
     END-IF
     IF L-HAS-RECORD = 1 AND L-SONG >= 0
         MOVE L-COMPARATOR TO BE-XI(L-INDEX, 5)
         CALL "BE4-JUKEBOX-PLAY" USING L-INDEX L-SONG L-LENGTH L-EVENT WS-STOPPED
     ELSE
         CALL "BE4-JUKEBOX-STOP" USING L-INDEX WS-STOPPED L-EVENT
     END-IF
