 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. BE4-BRUSH.
*> USING index, game time, hit direction, completed out, scheduled tick delay out (0 none), dusted out, dusted changed out: brush of 7.4 steps 1 to 8 (the loot is unpacked by the caller).
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY BESTATE.
 01 WS-BEFORE              BINARY-LONG.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-INDEX                BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-TIME                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-DIRECTION            BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-COMPLETED            BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-SCHEDULE             BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-DUSTED               BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-CHANGED              BINARY-LONG.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-INDEX L-TIME L-DIRECTION L-COMPLETED L-SCHEDULE L-DUSTED L-CHANGED.
     MOVE 0 TO L-COMPLETED L-SCHEDULE L-CHANGED
     CALL "BE4-BRUSH-STATE" USING BE-XI(L-INDEX, 1) L-DUSTED
     IF BE-XI(L-INDEX, 4) < 0
         MOVE L-DIRECTION TO BE-XI(L-INDEX, 4)
     END-IF
     COMPUTE BE-XI(L-INDEX, 2) = L-TIME + 40
