     CALL "BE4-BRUSH-STATE" USING BE-XI(L-INDEX, 1) L-DUSTED
     IF BE-XI(L-INDEX, 1) >= 10
         MOVE 1 TO L-COMPLETED
     ELSE
         MOVE 2 TO L-SCHEDULE
     END-IF
     IF WS-BEFORE NOT = L-DUSTED
         MOVE 1 TO L-CHANGED
     END-IF
     GOBACK.
