 PROGRAM-ID. BE4-SAVE.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY BESTATE.
 01 WN                     PIC X(32).
 01 WL                     BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-T-COMPOUND          BINARY-LONG VALUE 10.
 01 WS-T-NONE              BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-FOUR                BINARY-LONG VALUE 4.
 01 WS-THREE               BINARY-LONG VALUE 3.
