 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY BESTATE.
 01 WN                     PIC X(32).
 01 WL                     BINARY-LONG.
 01 WN2                    PIC X(32).
 01 WL2                    BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-CAP32               BINARY-LONG VALUE 32.
 01 WS-CAP64               BINARY-LONG VALUE 64.
 01 WS-CAP-INTS            BINARY-LONG VALUE 64.
 01 WS-TYPE                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-TYPE2               BINARY-LONG.
